1
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Hello, Ms. Zeng.

2
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:36,799
How are the pills working for you lately?

3
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:41,399
The effects are a bit slow, right?

4
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:43,359
That's completely normal.

5
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:44,679
I told you before,

6
00:00:44,679 --> 00:00:46,119
our pills and other brands'

7
00:00:46,119 --> 00:00:47,200
are definitely different.

8
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:49,280
You know why our pills work?

9
00:00:49,280 --> 00:00:51,000
It's because they prevent rebounding!

10
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:53,679
Are you crazy?!

11
00:00:55,079 --> 00:00:56,159
Tangtang, let's talk when we get home.

12
00:00:56,159 --> 00:00:56,679
Don't follow me.

13
00:00:56,679 --> 00:00:57,240
Listen to me, let me explain.

14
00:00:58,240 --> 00:00:59,320
Hello, two whiskeys.

15
00:00:59,960 --> 00:01:00,920
No, I was just...

16
00:01:00,920 --> 00:01:02,000
Two whiskeys.

17
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:03,399
I wasn't saying you're crazy.

18
00:01:04,599 --> 00:01:05,400
Here's the thing.

19
00:01:05,879 --> 00:01:07,200
Tell you what, let me find a quieter spot

20
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:08,200
to talk to you.

21
00:01:11,760 --> 00:01:13,920
You've got to control your diet!

22
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:16,959
You have to watch what you eat and drink.

23
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:20,400
Right, these carbs, staple foods,

24
00:01:20,599 --> 00:01:24,159
you can't eat rice or steamed buns.

25
00:01:24,599 --> 00:01:27,359
Also, you must make sure to exercise.

26
00:01:27,879 --> 00:01:30,159
There are pills that don't require diets,

27
00:01:30,719 --> 00:01:32,000
but they have side effects.

28
00:01:33,239 --> 00:01:34,159
Ours don't.

29
00:01:34,159 --> 00:01:35,359
Right, I take them myself.

30
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:37,079
Don't you worry.

31
00:01:38,799 --> 00:01:39,799
Tell you what, Ma'am.

32
00:01:40,359 --> 00:01:43,079
If you still have your doubts,

33
00:01:43,439 --> 00:01:45,599
then... then just don't buy them anymore.

34
00:01:46,519 --> 00:01:47,439
I... No.

35
00:01:47,439 --> 00:01:49,159
How could I be threatening you?

36
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:50,159
Here's what we'll do.

37
00:01:50,159 --> 00:01:51,959
I'll... I'll give you a course for free.

38
00:01:53,359 --> 00:01:54,879
Right, right, thanks for understanding, Ma'am.

39
00:01:55,719 --> 00:01:56,719
Okay, okay.

40
00:01:57,319 --> 00:01:58,599
Bye, Ma'am.

41
00:01:59,319 --> 00:01:59,959
Okay.

42
00:03:12,159 --> 00:03:13,120
My treat.

43
00:03:16,159 --> 00:03:17,400
Who are you?

44
00:03:17,719 --> 00:03:19,759
I heard you selling diet pills earlier.

45
00:03:21,759 --> 00:03:22,919
That was you?

46
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:23,719
Yeah.

47
00:03:24,599 --> 00:03:26,159
Yeah, so what?

48
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:27,719
I want to buy some.

49
00:03:32,120 --> 00:03:35,439
Your starting weight is too low.

50
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:37,719
You can't handle my pills.

51
00:03:37,879 --> 00:03:39,919
Didn't you say on the phone earlier

52
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:41,159
that there are no side effects?

53
00:03:41,159 --> 00:03:42,159
There are no side effects.

54
00:03:42,159 --> 00:03:43,319
I take them myself.

55
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:44,919
So are you selling them or not?

56
00:03:59,000 --> 00:03:59,560
Bro.

57
00:04:01,879 --> 00:04:03,199
You looking to buy the meds?

58
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:05,319
Didn't you say you weren't selling?

59
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:07,159
I just thought I didn't have any on me.

60
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:15,000
Is it really safe?

61
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:18,439
Absolutely no side effects.

62
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:21,120
This bottle guarantees ten pounds.

63
00:04:21,519 --> 00:04:22,319
Ten pounds?

64
00:04:23,319 --> 00:04:24,160
How much?

65
00:04:24,519 --> 00:04:26,519
Let's exchange contacts.

66
00:04:26,519 --> 00:04:28,560
I'll send you the price list.

67
00:04:30,040 --> 00:04:31,959
Xie Xin, you're hiding from me, aren't you?

68
00:04:31,959 --> 00:04:34,040
Brother Tie, what are you doing here?

69
00:04:35,639 --> 00:04:37,959
Brother Tie! Brother Tie! Brother Tie!

70
00:04:38,399 --> 00:04:40,480
If I can just close this deal today,

71
00:04:42,399 --> 00:04:43,600
I'll be able to pay you back.

72
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:46,720
Come on, Brother Tie.

73
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:47,439
You're so unreliable.

74
00:04:47,439 --> 00:04:48,279
Brother Tie! Brother Tie!

75
00:04:48,279 --> 00:04:49,519
Don't be mad. Sit, sit, sit.

76
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:52,079
He loves to joke around. Always joking.

77
00:04:52,240 --> 00:04:54,399
This is my good brother, Brother Tie.

78
00:06:08,720 --> 00:06:09,519
You are...?

79
00:06:13,079 --> 00:06:13,959
Thank you. Thank you.

80
00:06:16,959 --> 00:06:17,959
My treat.

81
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:22,199
Tell me, who is that bitch that seduced you?

82
00:07:22,399 --> 00:07:23,560
That- That was a client.

83
00:07:23,959 --> 00:07:25,920
A client? What client?

84
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:27,360
You two were in bed together!

85
00:07:27,639 --> 00:07:28,480
She really is a client!

86
00:07:28,800 --> 00:07:29,519
She was drunk!

87
00:07:29,519 --> 00:07:30,439
I helped her into the hotel.

88
00:07:30,439 --> 00:07:31,360
What did I even do?

89
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:34,000
This lady is going to beat you to death!

90
00:07:35,079 --> 00:07:35,519
Don't run!

91
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:37,120
That's not true!

92
00:07:37,399 --> 00:07:38,079
Nothing happened!

93
00:07:38,079 --> 00:07:38,920
She really is a client!

94
00:07:40,560 --> 00:07:42,000
If she's not a client, then what is she?

95
00:07:42,199 --> 00:07:44,240
You better explain this clearly!

96
00:07:44,639 --> 00:07:45,959
I'm divorcing you today!

97
00:07:46,600 --> 00:07:48,399
She really is a client! She really is!

98
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:56,319
Brother Tie!

99
00:07:56,839 --> 00:07:58,000
Where- Where is this?

100
00:07:58,160 --> 00:07:59,399
Is this about the money?

101
00:07:59,519 --> 00:08:00,759
I'll definitely pay it back!

102
00:08:00,959 --> 00:08:02,399
It's- It's just going to take a little time.

103
00:08:02,399 --> 00:08:03,600
Don't be in such a rush!

104
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:05,319
Brother- Brother Tie- Brother Tie!

105
00:08:13,959 --> 00:08:15,199
You dare fight back?!

106
00:08:17,519 --> 00:08:18,399
Ma'am Su Li!

107
00:08:22,399 --> 00:08:23,759
Ma'am! Ma'am! Ma'am!

108
00:08:23,759 --> 00:08:24,959
This is a family matter.

109
00:08:24,959 --> 00:08:26,399
I just- It's not my place.

110
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:28,319
It was an emergency!

111
00:08:28,439 --> 00:08:29,680
I couldn't find anyone else to help!

112
00:08:30,199 --> 00:08:31,519
Don't worry, you won't lose out.

113
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:32,720
Those diet pills of yours.

114
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:34,080
I'll buy ten more courses.

115
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:35,080
Then thank you, Ma'am.

116
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:43,720
Who is it?

117
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:47,440
Room Service.

118
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:49,679
I didn't order room service.

119
00:08:50,240 --> 00:08:51,600
He didn't order anything. Let's go.

120
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:51,919
Hurry up!

121
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:56,360
The hotel is giving you a complimentary fruit platter.

122
00:08:57,919 --> 00:08:58,600
Wait a minute!

123
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:00,759
Move!

124
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:01,759
Get out of the way!

125
00:09:01,879 --> 00:09:02,799
What? What are you doing?

126
00:09:02,799 --> 00:09:03,840
Get in! Hurry up and get in!

127
00:09:05,039 --> 00:09:05,519
I'm so sorry!

128
00:09:05,519 --> 00:09:06,720
Sorry! Sorry! Sorry!

129
00:09:07,159 --> 00:09:08,759
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

130
00:09:09,279 --> 00:09:10,480
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

131
00:09:10,879 --> 00:09:11,879
Keep a close watch.

132
00:09:12,159 --> 00:09:13,159
Don't go anywhere.

133
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:14,559
I'm keeping my eyes on you!

134
00:09:20,679 --> 00:09:21,919
I'll just- I'll just sit right here.

135
00:09:23,120 --> 00:09:23,559
Good.

136
00:09:28,240 --> 00:09:29,559
This lady is going to fight you to the death!

137
00:09:33,039 --> 00:09:36,159
The score is now nineteen to nineteen.

138
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:38,080
We've reached match point!

139
00:09:38,440 --> 00:09:39,000
Wait a minute!

140
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:42,039
I slipped and fell just now! I'm fine!

141
00:09:43,679 --> 00:09:45,240
Red scores an effective hit!

142
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:46,360
Gaining another point!

143
00:09:52,679 --> 00:09:53,399
This lady is exhausted!

144
00:09:54,120 --> 00:09:55,159
That'll teach you to cheat on me!

145
00:09:55,320 --> 00:09:57,080
If there's a next time, I'll beat you to death!

146
00:10:08,679 --> 00:10:11,080
Please welcome the next contestant.

147
00:10:14,279 --> 00:10:15,759
The next contestant,

148
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:18,039
please take the stage.

149
00:10:24,159 --> 00:10:25,080
Now,

150
00:10:26,120 --> 00:10:28,399
let me explain the rules to you.

151
00:10:29,159 --> 00:10:30,159
It's very simple.

152
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:32,679
The time limit is ten minutes.

153
00:10:33,519 --> 00:10:34,559
During this time,

154
00:10:35,279 --> 00:10:36,919
you must face your opponent's challenge.

155
00:10:37,639 --> 00:10:39,120
If either of you

156
00:10:39,120 --> 00:10:40,279
takes an effective hit,

157
00:10:40,559 --> 00:10:41,919
your opponent scores a point.

158
00:10:42,279 --> 00:10:43,960
The first to reach 20 points

159
00:10:44,919 --> 00:10:46,120
wins the match.

160
00:10:52,759 --> 00:10:53,399
Brother Tie!

161
00:10:57,360 --> 00:10:59,000
Brother Tie, you... what is this?

162
00:10:59,039 --> 00:10:59,639
Come on!

163
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:01,159
No, Brother Tie.

164
00:11:01,159 --> 00:11:01,919
Because I just...

165
00:11:02,360 --> 00:11:04,000
Because I... I just passed out.

166
00:11:04,120 --> 00:11:05,559
It's nothing. So, I should probably...

167
00:11:05,559 --> 00:11:06,120
go.

168
00:11:06,360 --> 00:11:06,879
Brother Tie!

169
00:11:06,879 --> 00:11:07,279
Go!

170
00:11:07,759 --> 00:11:08,279
Go on.

171
00:11:08,399 --> 00:11:08,960
Brother Tie!

172
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:21,159
Did you tie me up and bring me here

173
00:11:21,799 --> 00:11:23,519
because of my medicine?

174
00:11:25,399 --> 00:11:26,840
So it is about the medicine.

175
00:11:26,919 --> 00:11:28,720
I can explain this!

176
00:11:29,240 --> 00:11:29,799
Tell you what.

177
00:11:30,360 --> 00:11:31,799
Let's... let's talk outside.

178
00:11:31,879 --> 00:11:32,600
Let's go outside.

179
00:11:32,639 --> 00:11:33,159
Let's step outside.

180
00:11:43,679 --> 00:11:44,960
Fun, fun, fun!

181
00:11:52,159 --> 00:11:54,639
My pills really have no medical effect,

182
00:11:54,879 --> 00:11:56,039
but they don't hurt anyone!

183
00:11:56,120 --> 00:11:57,519
It's... it's all protein powder.

184
00:11:57,759 --> 00:12:00,159
And... and I took it for a long time.

185
00:12:00,399 --> 00:12:02,000
I made sure it wasn't harmful to the body

186
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:02,879
before I dared to sell it.

187
00:12:03,159 --> 00:12:04,360
I remind them every time,

188
00:12:04,360 --> 00:12:05,879
telling them to exercise more.

189
00:12:05,879 --> 00:12:07,519
Then if you... you take protein powder,

190
00:12:07,519 --> 00:12:08,240
isn't that... isn't that...

191
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:09,519
isn't that just losing weight?

192
00:12:09,679 --> 00:12:10,679
There's nothing wrong with that!

193
00:12:15,279 --> 00:12:17,240
Just let me out, please?

194
00:12:17,519 --> 00:12:18,919
We can go down and talk this over.

195
00:12:24,360 --> 00:12:25,279
Put it on.

196
00:12:29,480 --> 00:12:30,279
You have to put it on.

197
00:12:32,879 --> 00:12:33,559
Okay.

198
00:12:34,679 --> 00:12:35,600
I get it.

199
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:38,919
If I win the boxing match, you let me go.

200
00:12:39,480 --> 00:12:40,159
Right?

201
00:12:42,559 --> 00:12:45,360
Very good. But for the sake of fairness,

202
00:12:45,759 --> 00:12:47,440
there's an additional rule for this round.

203
00:12:47,480 --> 00:12:49,039
I don't even understand the regular rules,

204
00:12:49,639 --> 00:12:50,879
let alone an additional one.

205
00:12:53,759 --> 00:12:55,000
Just be good and put it on.

206
00:12:59,519 --> 00:13:00,600
No, wait, this...

207
00:13:00,919 --> 00:13:02,240
I don't know how to box.

208
00:13:02,279 --> 00:13:03,360
And you're forcing me to wear a blindfold?

209
00:13:03,360 --> 00:13:04,159
Then I'll be even more helpless...

210
00:13:07,039 --> 00:13:10,039
Do not take off the blindfold during the match.

211
00:13:11,639 --> 00:13:12,279
Because I...

212
00:13:12,639 --> 00:13:14,039
I... I really don't know how to fight.

213
00:13:14,039 --> 00:13:15,480
I really don't know how to box.

214
00:13:15,519 --> 00:13:16,519
We can start.

215
00:13:16,639 --> 00:13:18,039
What? What do you mean start?

216
00:13:19,039 --> 00:13:21,279
Fighters, please get ready.

217
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:23,000
The match...

218
00:13:23,559 --> 00:13:25,279
begins!

219
00:13:31,039 --> 00:13:32,600
What do you mean the match begins?

220
00:13:32,879 --> 00:13:34,559
Can we make this clear?

221
00:13:37,120 --> 00:13:38,159
Shades guy!

222
00:13:38,799 --> 00:13:40,360
What... what's going on?

223
00:13:40,399 --> 00:13:41,360
Can someone tell me?

224
00:13:41,360 --> 00:13:42,639
The rules aren't even clear!

225
00:13:43,519 --> 00:13:44,919
Fighters get ready!

226
00:13:53,120 --> 00:13:54,279
I just said it!

227
00:13:54,279 --> 00:13:55,679
I'm wearing a blindfold now!

228
00:13:55,679 --> 00:13:56,480
I can't see!

229
00:13:56,480 --> 00:13:57,559
I can't fight!

230
00:13:59,879 --> 00:14:00,559
Who's there?

231
00:14:02,679 --> 00:14:05,120
That... that... that guy in sunglasses!

232
00:14:05,240 --> 00:14:07,639
What are you yelling for? I'm coming!

233
00:14:08,399 --> 00:14:09,080
Who is this?

234
00:14:09,879 --> 00:14:13,200
Ref, they're not in my weight class!

235
00:14:13,240 --> 00:14:15,279
I can tell just by the sound of it!

236
00:14:29,120 --> 00:14:31,320
Lin Dong, effective hit. One to zero.

237
00:14:31,519 --> 00:14:32,919
Damn, they're actually fighting!

238
00:14:33,159 --> 00:14:33,840
Don't...

239
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:36,320
Stop hitting me! Stop hitting me!

240
00:14:36,399 --> 00:14:38,120
You might as well just kill me!

241
00:14:38,799 --> 00:14:40,519
This is illegal! Five to zero.

242
00:14:41,559 --> 00:14:42,799
Fun, fun, fun!

243
00:14:42,799 --> 00:14:46,200
Murder! Murder! This is illegal!

244
00:14:47,519 --> 00:14:49,919
Lin Dong, effective hit. Nineteen to zero.

245
00:14:50,519 --> 00:14:51,919
This is murder!

246
00:14:53,320 --> 00:14:55,320
Come on, kid!

247
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:56,799
Come out!

248
00:14:57,399 --> 00:14:58,320
Make a sound!

249
00:15:00,159 --> 00:15:01,919
Bro, you can't see either, right?

250
00:15:01,919 --> 00:15:03,799
So what if I can't see?

251
00:15:04,120 --> 00:15:05,759
If neither of us can see,

252
00:15:05,799 --> 00:15:07,120
let's just stop fighting.

253
00:15:07,279 --> 00:15:09,159
You just like taking advantage of my blindness

254
00:15:09,159 --> 00:15:11,000
to do sneaky stuff.

255
00:15:12,039 --> 00:15:13,279
Take this!

256
00:15:14,080 --> 00:15:14,759
Take that!

257
00:15:16,480 --> 00:15:17,320
Take that!

258
00:15:18,039 --> 00:15:19,279
Come on, you little brat!

259
00:15:19,279 --> 00:15:20,720
Wait, are you Old Lin?

260
00:16:00,120 --> 00:16:00,879
Grandpa Lin.

261
00:16:01,480 --> 00:16:02,799
Xie Xin, school's out?

262
00:16:03,039 --> 00:16:03,720
Yeah, school's out.

263
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:05,000
How much is an ice cream?

264
00:16:05,120 --> 00:16:05,919
One fifty.

265
00:16:06,639 --> 00:16:07,120
Okay.

266
00:16:29,480 --> 00:16:30,120
Let's go.

267
00:16:30,519 --> 00:16:31,039
Let's go.

268
00:16:32,720 --> 00:16:33,879
I did cheat back then.

269
00:16:35,120 --> 00:16:37,240
I only paid five mao for a 1.5-yuan ice cream.

270
00:16:37,759 --> 00:16:39,440
Then when I went to your house back then,

271
00:16:39,480 --> 00:16:40,879
why didn't you admit it?

272
00:16:41,240 --> 00:16:42,519
Because I was afraid my mom would hit me.

273
00:16:43,039 --> 00:16:45,080
Just for this, the neighbor scolded me so badly,

274
00:16:45,360 --> 00:16:47,120
calling me black-hearted and blind,

275
00:16:47,360 --> 00:16:48,399
and saying I wronged a kid.

276
00:16:48,519 --> 00:16:51,120
I didn't know about this back then, Old Lin.

277
00:16:51,600 --> 00:16:53,360
One minute left until the match ends.

278
00:16:54,120 --> 00:16:54,759
Come on!

279
00:16:55,039 --> 00:16:56,080
Wait, wait, wait!

280
00:16:56,360 --> 00:16:57,080
Let me ask something.

281
00:16:57,279 --> 00:16:58,639
If this minute passes

282
00:16:58,639 --> 00:17:00,159
and there is no winner, what happens?

283
00:17:00,399 --> 00:17:01,639
Both sides will take a loss

284
00:17:02,120 --> 00:17:04,000
and receive punishment.

285
00:17:06,519 --> 00:17:07,359
Old Lin.

286
00:17:08,279 --> 00:17:09,000
I'm sorry.

287
00:17:16,119 --> 00:17:17,240
Taking the initiative like me...

288
00:17:19,160 --> 00:17:19,839
Xie Xin!

289
00:17:36,680 --> 00:17:38,279
Contestants, please take a short break.

290
00:17:38,279 --> 00:17:39,960
The next match will begin shortly.

291
00:17:42,799 --> 00:17:44,039
When did you change clothes?

292
00:17:45,039 --> 00:17:46,000
Doesn't matter, doesn't matter.

293
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:48,839
Hold on a second.

294
00:17:49,680 --> 00:17:51,240
What do you mean "the next match"?

295
00:17:51,880 --> 00:17:53,000
Am I fighting every match?

296
00:18:00,039 --> 00:18:01,160
Today, you have a total of

297
00:18:02,599 --> 00:18:03,440
five opponents.

298
00:18:04,079 --> 00:18:05,400
I have to get shocked four more times?

299
00:18:05,680 --> 00:18:06,480
Right, right, right.

300
00:18:13,440 --> 00:18:15,240
So you're going to keep losing, right?

301
00:18:16,079 --> 00:18:16,680
Yeah.

302
00:18:17,440 --> 00:18:18,680
Then just win.

303
00:18:20,599 --> 00:18:21,599
Losing is good, losing is good.

304
00:18:21,759 --> 00:18:23,079
You get shocked if you lose.

305
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:25,319
You just want to watch me get shocked, right?

306
00:18:26,680 --> 00:18:27,519
Don't you like getting shocked?

307
00:18:27,519 --> 00:18:28,640
Who likes getting shocked?!

308
00:18:28,680 --> 00:18:29,599
You're the one who likes getting shocked!

309
00:18:29,599 --> 00:18:30,920
You're such a Sicko!

310
00:18:32,200 --> 00:18:32,799
You Sicko!

311
00:18:32,799 --> 00:18:34,480
I'm a Si... I'm a Sicko?

312
00:18:34,680 --> 00:18:35,759
You kidnapped me!

313
00:18:35,759 --> 00:18:37,079
You're the real Sicko!

314
00:18:37,079 --> 00:18:37,799
You Sicko!

315
00:18:37,799 --> 00:18:39,319
I'm only fighting so I can escape!

316
00:18:39,519 --> 00:18:40,839
You're the Sicko here!

317
00:18:44,680 --> 00:18:46,200
Please welcome the next contestant,

318
00:18:46,519 --> 00:18:47,680
Chen Hao!
